# Working material of the agent workflow — plans, specs, hand-off notes.
# It stays on the workstation and out of the repository on purpose: once a
# plan's content has moved into docs/decisions/, keeping the plan under git
# leaves two sources of truth, and the stale one is the one somebody reads.
# Deleting it outright would throw away notes that are still useful while the
# work is fresh, so it lives locally instead.
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/
